PURPOSE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is made publicly available so that official judges and
authorized reviewers of the Build with Gemini / XPRIZE hackathon can access,
inspect, run, test, and evaluate the Rolebolt submission.

Public visibility on GitHub does NOT mean this software is open source, and
does NOT grant the general public permission to use, copy, modify, fork,
redistribute, deploy, or commercialize the code.

