2. LIMITED PERMISSION FOR OFFICIAL EVALUATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Authorized Reviewers may, solely for Evaluation Purposes:

  (a) view and browse this repository;
  (b) clone or download the Software as needed to inspect and test it;
  (c) run the Software locally or in a test environment; and
  (d) evaluate the submission for scoring and verification.

"Authorized Reviewers" means official judges, contest administrators, and
reviewers acting for Build with Gemini / XPRIZE evaluation (including Devpost,
Hacker Fund, Google, and accounts such as testing@devpost.com and
judging@hacker.fund), when acting in that official capacity.

"Evaluation Purposes" means reviewing, testing, scoring, and verifying the
submission during the contest submission and judging periods.

This limited permission ends when the relevant judging period ends, or earlier
if Rolebolt withdraws the submission or revokes access. After evaluation,
reviewers should delete retained copies unless Rolebolt provides written
permission to keep them.

